{"seq": 24, "tool": "submit", "kind": "terminal", "args": {"decision": "backfill", "root_cause": "source:branches", "summary": "The weekly branch snapshot branches_20261005.csv arrived late, on 2026-10-06 at 11:20, after the 06:00 run. dim_branch therefore lacked BR-033 and BR-034, which opened on 10-06 and 10-07, and loans for those branches failed the relationship test. I re-ran ingest_branches for 10-05 and backfilled dim_branch and its downstream models for 10-06 to 10-08. No loans now have an orphan branch code. The raw.payments volume alert on 10-07 is benign. The extra rows are CDC correction events, and stg_payments keeps the highest cdc_seq per payment, so I took no action on it.", "evidence": ["ALR-58FA8B", "ALR-155D32", "landing/_transfer_log arrival of branches_20261005.csv at 2026-10-06 11:20", "tr-000160 ingest_branches ran 06:02 before the file arrived", "announcements: BR-033 opens 10-06, BR-034 opens 10-07", "stg_payments dedups on cdc_seq", "query: 0 orphan branch_codes after backfill"]}, "ok": true, "error": null, "result_chars": 47, "duration_ms": 0.2, "sim_now": "2026-10-09 08:37:20"}
